{"candidateAnswer":"LeBron James","evidence":"[D12:20 | 3:00 pm on 2 October, 2023] John: Thanks! The Wolves are my team for sure. And LeBron is the man - love his skills and leadership.\n[D12:22 | 3:00 pm on 2 October, 2023] John: I really admire his work ethic and dedication to the game, such an inspiration.\n[D16:9 | 11:41 am on 6 November, 2023] Tim: I just love watching LeBron. There was this Finals game a few years back with an epic block that totally changed the game and ended up winning it. Seeing him go for it like that was such an inspiration - never give up, you know?","itemId":"urn:uuid:673e372d-1ad7-5704-95d3-d1b9ac4ee5ca","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:1e5409aa03f7e541e517f8c08ff270b229a2fd61ca064a80e3200cc5852b0063","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Who is Tim and John's favorite basketball player?","referenceAnswer":"LeBron James","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"1e5409aa03f7e541e517f8c08ff270b229a2fd61ca064a80e3200cc5852b0063"}}]}